home='<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-grid wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span> MOBILE GAMES. DIFFERENT DIRECTIONS.</p><h1>Find your next<br><em>car game.</em></h1><p class="intro">Open roads. Head-to-head races. Motorcycle challenges. Parking puzzles. Find the game that fits the way you want to play.</p><div class="featured-download"><p class="feature-label">FEATURED / CAR GAMES</p>'+stores(ids[0])+'<p class="hero-note">Official iOS and Android downloads.</p></div><a class="hero-jump" href="#apps">Explore all four games <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><figure class="hero-shot"><div class="shot-top"><span>01 / OPEN-WORLD DRIVING</span><span class="live-label">GAMEPLAY</span></div><div class="hero-image">'+img('1478453789-screen-1.webp','Car Games official iOS screenshot: an orange car exploring a city road',False)+'</div><figcaption><div><strong>Car Games</strong><p>Choose a vehicle. Find your own route.</p></div><a href="/games/car-games/" aria-label="See Car Games features">↗</a></figcaption><p class="shot-disclosure">Official iOS screenshot. Features and appearance differ by platform.</p></figure></div><div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>YOUR NEXT SESSION STARTS HERE</span><span>EXPLORE / RACE / RIDE / PARK</span></div></section><section class="wrap apps-section" id="apps"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PICK YOUR LANE</p><h2>Four games.<br>More ways to play.</h2></div><p>Get a feel for the game, check the features for your device and go straight to the official store.</p></div><nav class="game-shortcuts" aria-label="Jump to a game">'+''.join('<a href="#'+detail[i]['slug']+'"><span>'+str(n+1).zfill(2)+'</span>'+E(display_name(i))+'</a>' for n,i in enumerate(ids))+'</nav><div class="app-grid">'+cards()+'</div><p class="catalogue-note">Free to download on the US App Store. See your store for current regional prices, optional purchases and subscription terms.</p></section><section class="choose-section" id="choose"><div class="wrap choice-grid"><div class="choice-intro"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT KIND OF PLAYER ARE YOU?</p><h2>Your game.<br>Your own pace.</h2><p>There is more than one way to enjoy a vehicle game. Choose the decisions you want to make.</p><a class="button dark" href="/guides/choose-a-driving-game/">Find your driving game <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="lanes">'+chooser+'</div></div></section><section class="wrap before-download"><p class="eyebrow">A BETTER FIT STARTS WITH THE DETAILS</p><h2>Know before you go.</h2><div class="practical-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Pick your platform.</h3><p>All four games are available for iPhone, iPad and Android. Find the features for your device on each game page.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Check your setup.</h3><p>Want to play offline? Try Parking Games on iPhone, iPad or Android, or choose Car Games on Android. Racing Clash brings players together online.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Go straight to the source.</h3><p>Download from the App Store for iPhone and iPad, or Google Play for Android. Need help? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch.</a></p></div></div></section><section class="research-band"><div class="wrap research"><div><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH &amp; PLAYER EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Curious about play.</h2></div><div>'+paragraphs([research['research'],research['researchGoal']])+'<p class="fine">Research goals do not establish clinical efficacy or institutional endorsement.</p></div></div></section></main>'
